  "details": "When another user spawns an item to goof off, and we want to join in the fun, it's a bit inconvenient to have to go through the inventory to spawn that specific item - and it will get more and more inconvenient over time with the number of items you own.\n\nIt would be neat if in the item menu (that appears when you highlight an item with your laser pointer, where you can hide it etc.) there was an option to 'clone'/spawn your own copy of that item.\n\nAll assuming you own that item too, of course.",
